  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_005 (multimodal, multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer agg, concat fusion) achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.585594). This experiment tests changing the image encoder from imagenet_vit_l to resnet50 while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion type the same. This isolates the effect of the image encoder choice, which is critical for determining whether the current top performer's image encoder is optimal. It balances exploitation of the high-performing multiprofile setup with exploration of a key design choice."
}

